1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
@RainShowerScene{Music:Play|name=waiting_rain_theme|fadeIn=2.0|baseVolume=0.5|endTime=75.0}{SFX:Play|name=river_water|endTime=15|baseVolume=0.16}{SFX:Play|name=wind_leaves|endTime=27|baseVolume=0.14}{SFX:Play|name=morning_birds|endTime=14|baseVolume=0.10}

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
[Boy]{Voice:calm}云走得快了，风里有水汽。

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[Girl]{Voice:curious}要下雨了吧？

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,500
[Cat]{Voice:calm}跟我来。这条街我熟，淋不着。

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:01:02,000
{SFX:Play|name=rain_shower|baseVolume=0.28}

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
[Girl]{Voice:amazed}小橘，等等我们呀！

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,500
[Girl]{Voice:gentle}你怎么知道这里有屋檐呀？

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
[Cat]{Voice:proud}这条街的屋檐，我都量过。

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,000
[Boy]{Voice:calm}雨一下，街就只剩下线条了。

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
[Girl]{Voice:bright}又画？让我看看。

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:04,000
{SFX:Play|name=awning_drips|baseVolume=0.18}

12
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,000
[Cat]{Voice:gentle}雨小了。走吧，路洗干净了。

13
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:11,000
[Girl]{Voice:bright}你看，云边是金色的！

14
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:15,000
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}嗯。下过雨的日子，像新的一页。
